// Deflate - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# A raw deflate stream -- no zlib wrapper -- of "Hello World!",
# at level 9, produced by zlib. Backticks quote Huffman-coded bytes.
0000  F3 48 CD C9 C9 57 08 CF 2F CA 49 51 04 00       |.H...W../.IQ..|
